window.products.push({"id":638155,"name":"Atemws Absorbent Drink Coasters White Custom Coasters for Tabletop Protection Set of 6 with Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sjM627S3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"6pcs Coasters with Holder: They come with 6 modern white drink coasters for tabletop protection. Also come with a nice storage rack to hold all of the coaster when not in use. Pure white DIY coasters are available for you to design and customize your own coasters. They were well packed in a sturdy box with plenty of foam padding to avoid broken. 4-inch Proper Diameter: The bar coasters is large and sturdy enough to fit almost any cup or mug, like beer glasses, coffee cup, teacup and iced drinks on the tables and nightstands comfortably without sliding all around. The coasters do dry out thoroughly overnight and are ready for the next drink dry and ready to protect. Home and Office Cup Coasters: They do absorb the condensation well from daily cups and glasses and look totally clean after they dry. The coasters are strong, fairly absorbent, easy to clean and have a well-attached cork backing so no more complaining about how water cups condensation leaking all over your table and puddles on desks if you got the wonderful glasses coasters. Absorbent Coasters for Drinks: The thirstystone table coaster works great at absorbing moisture. Top side is ceramic to absorb the moister from the sweats out of drinks and the bottom is a cork makes the coasters stay in place and won't slide around or scratch fancy tabletop. Also the glasses or cups do not stick to the coaster when you pick up your drink, no spill overs on to the table or puddling on the coasters. Perfect Gift for Christmas: The creative coasters set would be a wonderful gift for family, friends and colleagues. If you had any questions, no matter the timing, just let us know we will do our best to offer effective solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sjM627S3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atemws","source_asin":"B0923LK41C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0923LK41C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0923LK41C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
