window.products.push({"id":638249,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer, 2022 EasyAcc Coffee Warmer for Desk [with Silicon Cup Lid] Smart Mug Warmer Auto Shut Off, 3 Temp Setting to 167℉, Touch Switch, LE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r4iiI-cML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉👉👉Warm Tips: Mug Warmer design to slow down the cooling speed of hot beverages, not design to heat up cold beverages. 💝【2022 Updated - Silicon Cup Lid for Free】Package include silicone cup lid (diameter: 12cm), which is made of food grade silicone. Safely seal your cups to prevent them from dust and cold air. Keep beverages warmer with our cup warm plate. ☕①【22 Watt Mug Warmer】EasyAcc 22-Watt Mug Warmer for use with coffee, tea, milk, hot cocoa and etc. Compared to other 16 watt/17 watt/19 watt devices, it will keep your beverages warmer in an equal time. ☕②【3-Temperature Settings】Our electric mug warmer can slow down the cooling speed of hot beverages while you are working, reading, writing etc. To keep warm to 131℉/149℉/167℉ (55℃/65℃/75℃ ). ☕③【For Suitable Mug】a thin-walled, flat-bottomed mug will have better warmth performance. Fit for different material cups, ceramic, glass, mug, stainless steel cups, as well as milk cartons. (Please don't use double-layer insulation cups ). ☕④【Safety】❶ The Electric Cup Warmer with auto-shut off function after 8 hours of inactivity. ❷ Bottom of the heater always stay under 65℃, do not worry to hurt your desk. ❸ Plate surrounding with silicone tubing for heat insulation. 💖 Please do not touch the heating surface after switching on or turning it off for a period of time. ☕⑤【Easy Operation】Plug in, touch “◯” to switch on, press left/right button to adjust temperature. LED screen to display the temp. Easy and Smart. (Please keep your mugs diameter within 3.15 inches) 🎁【For Gift】EasyAcc Coffee Mug Warmer keep the beverages warm all day long. It will be great gift for lover, dad, mom, wife, husband on Thanksgiving, Christmas, Valentine's Day and other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r4iiI-cML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EasyAcc","source_asin":"B0BPPNWFD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPPNWFD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPPNWFD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
