window.products.push({"id":638329,"name":"Tiger JAX-R10U-WY 5.5-Cup (Uncooked) Micom Rice Cooker & Warmer, Steamer, and Slow Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KYvGBeBKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tiger's Mincom Rice Cooker & Warmer, Steamer, and Slow Cooker allows you to cook more than rice. It comes with Tiger's unique \"tacos\" cooking plate, which allows you to synchronize rice cooking and main dish to cook two dishes at the same time. With minimal preparation and the press of a button, Automatic Cooking Logic actively monitors cooking temperatures to create the perfect meal. With automatic \"Keep Warm\" mode and the two preset delay timers (up to 24 hours), you can prepare easy and healthy dish to your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KYvGBeBKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiger","source_asin":"B01KTBQKW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KTBQKW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KTBQKW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":638330,"name":"Small Mermaid Playing the Guitar, Wall Hanging Decor, Nautical Sea Life Theme, Ocean Life Art 10.5 In. x 6 In.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZVh9Q1DYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Mermaids of folklore dating back to the time of Odysseus enchant sailors with their beautiful music. Is this gal a little bit country, or a little bit rock 'n' roll? It's easy to hang your sculpture with just a few nails. Place the first nail within two design elements that are touching or notched. Then use a second and possibly a third nail, if the sculpture is large, to straighten and secure the piece against the wall. Just make sure that you don't place a nail in an eye or a mouth. A viewer's attention will go there quite naturally and therefore, directly to the nail. You don't want that! This sculpture has been treated with a weather-proof coating. Over time, however, the coating will wear away and rusting will occur. Rust is not necessarily a bad thing. Some people crave a weathered look. Others prefer a glossy finish. If that is you, simply take five minutes once a year to apply a spray-on clear coat enamel. As with all of our sculptures, this mermaid comes to you through fair trade practices. Natural color variation from dark silver to rustic brown tones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZVh9Q1DYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"It's Cactus","source_asin":"B00VVR3VC0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VVR3VC0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VVR3VC0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
