window.products.push({"id":638485,"name":"COCKTAIL VEGAS [EXCLUSIVE PREMIUM QUALITY] 18/10 - 304 Stainless Steel 20-piece Flatware Set, Luxury Mirror Finish, Elegant Design [Quality Warranted]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91R+3ySuY7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We are manufacturing Housewares & Restaurant Flatware for over 50 years! We are Executive Chef's choice! Every single aspect of our flatware represents Premium Quality from Durability to Luxury to Elegance. Luxury Mirror Polishing means you can see your reflection clearly even after 1000's of washes! Comes with CockTail own Caddy Box making it ideal for presenting as a Gift for any occasion you like or can be used for storing! *******Our Caring Instructions*******✓✓Your cutlery should be rinsed off as soon as possible after use. Allowing food to dry on surface of the cutlery gives the scales and acids more time to act and causes tarnishing. ✓✓Remember not to use wire tool or washing powder as this can damage the metal. Use a soft sponge and washing up liquid for the best results. ✓✓To minimize the scratches wash few pieces at a time and avoid to rub them on each other. ✓✓ Stainless steel knives tend to have a higher carbon content which gives them a sharper edge; however this also makes them more susceptible to corrosion. Therefore, take extra care with knives. ✓✓Never leave wet cutlery out to dry. This is the quickest way to degrade the surface and the fastest route for spots to appear on the cutlery. Use a soft cotton dish towel to dry. *******Technical Specifications*******✓✓Spoons & Forks material American Iron & Steel Institute (AISI) number 304. The 304 material is the most Superior Quality material in Stainless Steel and it has got extreme ability of resistance to corrosion. The Durability, Cleanability and Attractive appearance are one of the many characteristics of 304 material and also used in Surgical instruments and Gold Platting. Thickness SWG 11 (2.946mm). Knives material SUS 420 J1. Thickness SWG 4 (5.893mm). Hardboard packaging box. ✓✓Lastly - Our Premium Quality flatware is a fantastic addition to your drawer and dinner table and the right care and attention can provide even longer lasting life. THANK YOU for buying with GreenKitchens!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91R+3ySuY7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenKitchens","source_asin":"B01M0FHAH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M0FHAH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M0FHAH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
