window.products.push({"id":638511,"name":"NOVICA Multicolor Floral Ceramic Sugar Bowl and Creamer, 8 oz, Guanajuato Festivals'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cy0IgfxrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: By Javier Servin, this set of sugar bowl and cream pitcher celebrates the many festivals that characterize Guanajuato. Music, cinema, hot-air balloons, classic cars, bicycles, a medieval fair, religious traditions and the renowned Cervantino cultural festival — their colors all come to life in handcrafted ceramic.Dishwasher safeFree of lead and toxinsHand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightlySigned by the artistAbout our Artist: Mexican artisan Javier Servin began his ceramic experience in Mexico City. 'Then I decided to start my own workshop at my parents' house,' he recalls. 'It was just my wife and I. In 1996, I returned to my village and have been able to offer jobs to more than 30 master ceramists in my community. After shaping the piece by hand, we trace the patterns with a burin for the decorative motifs, which we apply with glaze before firing. Our collections range from home decor to exhibition pieces.'...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cy0IgfxrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B014YUUI7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014YUUI7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014YUUI7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
