window.products.push({"id":638641,"name":"Lillian Vernon Hooded Animal Personalized Towel for Babies - Yellow Puppy, 100% Cotton, Large 30 x 30 inch Size, Machine Washable, Custom Embroidered","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gVSwQWpHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Make a splash after a bath or day at the beach Add a whimsical splash to bath time or a day at the beach or pool with a custom embroidered, Hooded Animal Personalized Towels from the Lillian Vernon Kids collection. Animal hooded wraps are a snugly way to dry off after bath, beach, or pool! These towels are soft on their skin, and the animal hoodies are not only fun, but they keep little heads warm too. Perfect for infants or toddlers, our cute hooded towels are made from super soft, thick, and plush 100% cotton which is super absorbent. Each hooded towel is machine washable. A design selection to match any personality With a huge selection of unisex designs available in the Lillian Vernon Hooded Animal Personalized Towel collection, you’re sure to find a towel that your newborn or toddler will love. Little girls and boys alike will love their own customized towel and they make a special present for any occasion - simply specify a name of up to 12 characters. About Lillian Vernon When Lillian Vernon launched her company in 1951, she had a dream of bringing joy to others through well-made, personalized gift products and other items. Thirty-six years later, she took Lillian Vernon public as the first company traded on the American Stock Exchange founded by a woman. Although she passed in 2015, we continue to follow in her footsteps by making our customers’ dreams more memorable with our expansive offering of unique and notable gifts. Choose from our wide range of personalized totes, rolling suitcases, handbags, beach and bath towels, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gVSwQWpHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lillian Vernon","source_asin":"B09SKS7RKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SKS7RKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SKS7RKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":638642,"name":"Fastupda Fleece Throw Blanket Super Soft Cozy Lightweight Comfort Warm for Sofa Bed Couch,(50\" x 80\"),Boho Throw Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7156P3iIaEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cotton,fleece VERSATILE USAGE SCENARIOS: Wrapping yourself in a plush blanket while reading a book, taking a nap or watching a movie at home or in the theater on cool autumn and winter evenings. Perfect outdoor blankets for flying, traveling, camping, picnicking or dozing off at the park, beach and swimming pool. The blanket is a must-have in your office, couch, living room, yard or even in cars. UNIQUE HIGH QUALITY FABRIC: The blanket still feels very soft after each wash, unlike cotton blankets, it does not shed or shrink. Any liquid spills (such as water, coffee, red wine) are easy to wipe off.Oil stains of hamburgers, fried chicken or French fries can be gently wiped away. CHOOSE YOUR FAVOURITE SIZE and PATTERN: This super soft plush throw blanket is made of high quality materials, which is softer and warmer than ordinary blankets. Soft Fleece Blankets Travel Throw Size of 50\"x 80\" is available. The patterns of our blankets can be tailored to your liking, the size and style of the blankets are very rich to suit your needs. EASY WASH and CARE:To ensure year round softness and prevent pilling up, it is recommended to machine wash this blanket with warm water on a gentle cycle separately; tumble dry at low temperature,and no shrinkage after washing and drying. The pattern will not fade and still remains attractive after washing. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: Customer satisfaction is of utmost importance to us. We're confident you'll love our products, but if you're not 100% SATISFIED, our customer service team will do anything to meet your requirements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7156P3iIaEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fastupda","source_asin":"B07VLJ2VSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VLJ2VSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VLJ2VSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
