window.products.push({"id":638661,"name":"Esmula Bartender Kit with Stylish Bamboo Stand, 12 Piece 25oz Cocktail Shaker Set for Mixed Drink, Professional Stainless Steel Bar Tool Set, Gift for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Ebm53ijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Professional Bar Display Tool】: The 12 pieces cocktail shaker set have enough basic accessories to eliminate the need to purchase other unnecessary bar tool accessories. Whether at home, at the bar or at the party, it allows you to become a professional bartender and mix delicious cocktails with ease. 【Easy to Store - Stylish Bamboo Stand】: The unique semicircular bamboo stand makes the bar table very neat and beautiful. The drawers and cabinets in the kitchen are no longer chaotic. The accessories are made of the high quality stainless steel alloy. The surface is finely polished to prevent rust and easy cleaning. All accessories can be washed in the dishwasher to make life easier and faster. 【12 Piece Complete Cocktail Kit】: The cocktail shaker set is the best tool for bartenders to make a wide variety of party cocktail or bar mixed drink. Include 25 oz Cocktail Shaker, 15/30ml Double Jigger, Strainer, Ice Tongs, Muddler, Spoon, Liquor Pourers*2, Bottle Stopper*2, Wine Opener, Bamboo Stand, Cocktail Recipes Booklet. 【Premium Bartender Kit】: You can create mixing drinks that made from a wide variety of liquors with this professional stainless steel cocktail shaker, including Frozen Blue Margarita, Margarita, Tequila Sunrise, Pink Lady, Singapore Sling, Mojito,Martini, Whiskey, Scotch, Vodka, Gin, Rum, Sake and more. You can use it for mixing any kind of drinks you want. 【Best Gift Choice】: The cocktail shaker kit has smooth mirror effect and unique bamboo stand design, is the best choice of people who like to mix drinks. It's best gift choice for festivals or business. If you have any questions during the purchase process, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Ebm53ijL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esmula","source_asin":"B09WYPFBPR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WYPFBPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WYPFBPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
