window.products.push({"id":638676,"name":"Plastic Free Reusable Silicone Food Bags by Zeal Trends (2x1500mL and 2x1000mL) BPA Free, Environment-Friendly bags - Food Grade Freezer, Dishwasher, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rZu336dXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are so many ways you can use the colorful Zeal Trends Plastic Free Reusable Food Bag.  Replace your single use plastics with our environment-friendly bags solution.  Protect your food with Zeal Trends Environment-friendly bags.  These plastic free zero waste kitchen products are ideal for freezing – each bag locks out freezer burn while keeping your food fresh and flavorful! Less freezer burn means less food waste, and that adds up to less money wasted. Zeal Trends Plastic Free Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags are tough and durable. The unique slide closure ensures the reusable silicone food storage bag give edge-to-edge sealing – ensuring the most protection from freezer burn.  Portion with Silicone Bags - Portion your favorite foods for freezing, thawing or microwaving… exactly what you need, when you need it. Zeal Trends Reusable Silicone Food Bag allows you total flexibility so you can easily portion your favorite foods. Make batches of your favorite soup, buy meat, chicken, fruit or veggies in bulk and separate them into the portions you need, place it in the freezer and you’re done – it’s that easy! You’ll always have your favorite foods on hand.Ultimate Silicone Heat Safe reusable silicone food storage bag - Heat your food portions in aZeal Trends Reusable Silicone Food Bag up to 440°F! Simply remove the plastic bar and your frozen Zeal Trends Reusable Silicone Storage Bag filled with the right portion turns into a Zeal Trend Heat Safe Bag… just like that! Makes daily meal prep a breeze… from the freezer to your plate! And … they’re dishwasher safe! We recommend turning them inside out to wash.Great pet food storage container solution.Pro Tips:Slider may be tight when bags are new, add cooking oil to the slider track to keep it moving.When using these reusable silicone food bags in the microwave, leave seal open 1-2\" to vent.  Bags are too heavy for sous vide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rZu336dXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zeal Trends","source_asin":"B07X3P7W8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X3P7W8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X3P7W8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
