window.products.push({"id":638702,"name":"Leggett & Platt Finley Wood Headboard Panel with Curved Top Rail and Slatted Grill Design, Maple Finish, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bDGwHrrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Finley headboard has a simple design that’s been around for a while, but available in some fun colors that give it an updated feel. Constructed of solid Plantation hardwood, the 44.5-inch headboard is designed with a curved top rail that straightens out at the ends to give it a bit of flair, while providing a great modern look that’s suitable for boys, girls, and even adults. The Finley is available in a Black, Maple, White or Merlot finish, each coated with a hand applied, 7-step process. Fashion doesn’t have to exclude the youngest members of your family and you can’t go wrong with the graceful and versatile Finley to create a timeless sleeping space that will stay in style as the years go by. This unit includes a headboard panel, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Finley Headboard comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett & Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and bar stools. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bDGwHrrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076BD72KL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BD72KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BD72KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
