window.products.push({"id":638869,"name":"DWTS DANWEITESI Salt and Pepper Shaker Set-Spice Dispenser with Adjustable Pour Hole - Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Shakers - for Himalayan, Kosher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715gnvgOKML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐Stylish and Classic Design: This salt and pepper shakers is a combination of a brushed stainless steel housing, a glass body and an adjustable pouring setting. Featuring a modern design, it is stylish and elegant while being practical and suitable for kitchen to table use. This unique salt and pepper shaker set is the perfect addition to any kitchen or dining table. ⭐Multiple Adjustable Pour Holes: This salt and pepper shaker set comes with an adjustable pour hole lid that can be easily rotated left and right to adjust the outlet holes. The lid has 4 unique settings, 3 of which are fine, coarse and open holes, so you can control the amount of salt and pepper for precise seasoning. There is also 1 hole for sealing to prevent moisture from the spices. ⭐Easy to Fill and Clean：This stainless steel salt pepper shaker set has a removable design for easy filling and cleaning. The clear glass body will tell you if it needs to be filled. The stainless steel top easily unscrews to reveal a wide opening for easy refilling. To clean, simply unscrew the stainless steel housing, rinse the glass bottle, and wipe dry.Durable salt shakers for the kitchen. ⭐Multiple Uses: The salt and pepper shaker set can be used not only for salt or pepper, but also for different spices. Depending on the thickness of the spices, the three dispensing holes are integrated in one design and the lid is rotated to allow the use of various spices. You can fill it with different spices, such as sugar, paprika, cinnamon, etc., according to your needs. ⭐Customer First：DWTS has been putting the interests of our customers at heart since the first day of its birth, and your happiness is our happiness! Your satisfaction is our satisfaction! If you encounter a problem, please contact us and we will reply to you at the first time to ensure you have a pleasant shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715gnvgOKML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DWTS DANWEITESI","source_asin":"B0B6F7VW1R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6F7VW1R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6F7VW1R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
