window.products.push({"id":638926,"name":"500 Thread Count Queen Celdon Green 100% Cotton Sheets & Pillowcase Set,4 Pc Extra Long Staple Combed Cotton Bedding,Fits Mattress 15'' Deep Pockets,P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61emYwJLgPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Get ready for a dreamy 5-Star comfort: ZECOTT brings you its premier collection of 500 Thread Count which will make you go WOW with its soft, silky and 5-Star hotel like comfort. This beautiful set consists of 1 Queen Flat Sheet (90\" x 102\"), 1 Queen Fitted Sheet (60\" x 80\" + 15\") and 2 Standard pillowcases (20\" x 30\"). So hurry up and bring home our pure “class apart” 100% Cotton, 500TC Celdon Green Sheet set and get the posh and luxurious 5 star sleep that you thoroughly deserve-every day! NO COMPROMISE Journey of a ZECOTT Sheet Set – A ZECOTT Sheet starts with the basic building block “A Cotton Ball”. We spin these cotton balls into yarn and convert the yarn into fabric using state of the art advanced Air Jet looms. We finish the fabric processing and dyeing using 100% environment friendly processes in our own facility and finally do hand stitching to give you a product which has stood testimony of time. This entire process takes place in-house to keep superior quality control Obsession to deliver luxury responsibly- To ensure we are always doing the right things, our entire production unit, wood pulp plantations for making Lyocell, supply chain, employee working conditions are put to a rigorous testing periodically. We are proud to be ISO, Oekotex, GOTS, BCI, Sedex, Wrap, CT PAT certifications. we ensure a fairer price for the cotton to the farmers, higher living wages for workers, respectful relationships, environment sustainability and respect for local culture. Wash Care Instructions and Product warranty: Our sheets get softer with each wash, resist fading. To get the best out of these sheets, ensure that: Use Non - Chlorine washing agents. Tumble dry on low heat, remove quickly to avoid wrinkles. If you face any issues with these sheets, feel free to direct message us on Amazon and we will quickly revert back to resolve your queries happily. We want to create a bond with you that lasts forever and would always strive to delight you each day! A product for every occasion – This sheet set is an ethical gifting choice for all your special occasions – Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthdays, Weddings, and Anniversaries. More than any occasion, it is the best gift you can give to pamper YOURSELF, YOUR FAMILY and YOUR LOVED ONES! So HAPPY BUYING!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61emYwJLgPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZECOTT","source_asin":"B08B6CQB5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-638926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B6CQB5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B6CQB5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
